WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,800
If the road conditions are good, you can run a little longer

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:03,960
If the road conditions are bad, it may not even reach 200 kilometers.

3
00:00:03,960 --> 00:00:06,040
It’s not bad to be able to run two hundred kilometers.

4
00:00:06,040 --> 00:00:07,960
But the road conditions there are not that good.

5
00:00:07,960 --> 00:00:10,240
It should only be able to run more than a hundred kilometers, right?

6
00:00:10,240 --> 00:00:12,120
In addition to refueling the car here

7
00:00:12,120 --> 00:00:14,440
Can you get another thing to hold the oil?

8
00:00:14,440 --> 00:00:16,000
I'm afraid I won't have gas over there

9
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:17,520
More oil will be needed then

10
00:00:17,520 --> 00:00:19,520
I need to prepare something that can be done

11
00:00:19,520 --> 00:00:20,440
I'll take you there

12
00:00:20,440 --> 00:00:24,760
Just go buy two oil drums, Brother Wu.

13
00:00:24,760 --> 00:00:25,840
Thank you very much

14
00:00:25,840 --> 00:00:27,440
Follow me and run here, little brother

15
00:00:27,440 --> 00:00:29,200
These are all small things. How much have you helped me?

16
00:00:29,200 --> 00:00:31,840
Isn't it normal for me to come over to help you? It's nothing.

17
00:00:31,840 --> 00:00:33,280
I have something urgent to go back to now.

18
00:00:33,280 --> 00:00:35,840
I have to ask someone to drive these two cars, so you can go back first.

19
00:00:35,840 --> 00:00:39,000
I'll go to the labor market to find you tomorrow. That's okay, bro.

20
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:40,160
Be careful when you drive

21
00:00:40,160 --> 00:00:50,110
Don't let anyone catch you. Go back, General.

22
00:00:50,110 --> 00:00:51,230
you are back

23
00:00:51,230 --> 00:00:52,470
I didn't come back all night last night

24
00:00:52,470 --> 00:00:54,310
We're both worried about you. It's okay.

25
00:00:54,310 --> 00:00:56,270
I didn't come back last night because I worked too late.

26
00:00:56,270 --> 00:00:58,670
The main reason is to understand Dongtianfudi, right?

27
00:00:58,670 --> 00:00:59,830
Have the five children's fevers gone away?
